    "decision": "official_bse_listing_notice_contains_typographical_year_error",
    "reason": "BSE Notice 20220112-10 is dated 12-Jan-2022 but one listing sentence says effective Thursday January 13, 2021. The same notice separately places the Special Pre-open Session on Thursday, January 13, 2022; BSE's official SME IPO Index release explicitly states the company is being listed effective Thursday, January 13, 2022; and the IPO prospectus opened 31-Dec-2021 and closed 05-Jan-2022. The 2021 year in the listing sentence is therefore retained as a source conflict, not used as the listing year."
  },
